Third-party assets bundled in web/public/app/
============================================

Fonts
-----
Figtree and Caprasimo are used under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 and are
included here. The stylesheets ALSO reference "Roobert Hebrew", which is a
commercially licensed typeface and is therefore NOT included in this
repository. The font stacks name it first and fall through to Figtree and then
to the platform UI font, so the pages render correctly without it. If you have
a licence for it, drop the woff2 at web/public/app/roobert-hebrew.woff2.

